'''Acceltra Prime''' is the [[Prime]]d counterpart of the {{Weapon|Acceltra}} micro-missile launcher, sporting increased damage, [[Critical Chance]], [[Critical Multiplier]], [[Status Chance]], explosion radius, and [[Reload Speed]], at the expense of some [[Fire Rate]]. Acceltra Prime was released alongside {{WF|Gauss Prime}} and {{Weapon|Akarius Prime}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Puncture}} and {{D|Impact}} damage.
*Rockets have a minimum arming distance of '''7''' meters and explode in a '''5''' meter radius after impacting a surface or enemy.
**Initial hit and explosion apply status separately.
**Explosion does not need direct line of sight to deal damage and will penetrate walls.
**Can benefit from {{M|Firestorm}} ({{M|Primed Firestorm|Primed}}) and {{M|Cautious Shot}}.
*Rocket direct impacts have a guaranteed {{D|Impact}} proc.
*Reloading while [[Maneuvers#Sprinting|sprinting]] gives a '''+25%''' [[reload speed]] bonus ('''+50%''' when used by {{WF|Gauss}}/{{WF|Gauss Prime}}).
*Innate {{Pol|Naramon}} and {{Pol|Madurai}} polarities.

{{Advantages|
}}
{{Disadvantages|
